Remove the microphone (voice dictation) from the composers.

The mic button sat next to the send button in a session's composer, on the
New session screen and in the side chat, and ⌘⌥V toggled it. Dictation is
unreliable here, and phones have their own voice input in the keyboard, so
all three mics are gone, with the ⌘⌥V shortcut and its row in Keyboard
shortcuts. ComposerMicButton, the dictation hooks and the server's
dictation endpoint are unchanged, only unused. Upstream's composer tests
that measured the mic check that it's gone.
Base: omnigent v0.18.0 (a8676d23e88d), after 0001-0034.
